          "text": "፳፭ ፤ ⟪ወበጽሐ ፡ ኤፌሶን ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያን ፡ ጊዜ ፡ ከእስክንድርያ ፡ ተሰዶ ፡ ኤፌ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሶን ፡ ደረሰ ፡",
