          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": "፳፰",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳፰ ፤ ⟪እስመ ፡ ይትጋደሎሙ ፡ ለአይሁድ ፡ ፈድ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፋደ ፡ በቅድመ ፡ ኵሉ ፡ ሕዝብ ፡ እንዘ ፡ ሀለዉ ፡ ጉቡ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አን ፡ ገሃደ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይልቁንም ፡ ተሰብስበው ፡ ሳለ ፡ በጉባኤ ፡",
